---
description: >-
  The translation pattern: an event (ItemAdded) feeds a read model
  (CartItems, referencing frame 03 via `->>`), which a second event
  (AccountingItemAdded) is translated from — showing cross-frame data flow
  through a read-model reference.
---
eventmodeling

tf 01 ui CartScreen
tf 02 cmd AddItem
tf 03 evt ItemAdded
tf 04 rmo CartItems ->> 03
tf 05 evt AccountingItemAdded
